      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a query for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a>, given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a>. Any provided bindings within\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a> are applied to the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>. The query is issued as-is without\nadditional pre-processing such as named parameter expansion. Results of the query are mapped onto\n<code>entityClass</code>.",
      "translation": "执行一个针对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a> 的查询，给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a>。在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a> 中提供的任何绑定都会应用到底层的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>。该查询按原样发出，不会进行额外的预处理（例如命名参数扩展）。查询结果将映射到 <code>entityClass</code> 上。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a query for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a> in the context of <code>entityClass</code>, given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在给定 <code>entityClass</code> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a> 的情况下，执行一个针对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a> 的查询。",
      "count": 2
