    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a query for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a>, given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a>. Any provided bindings within\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a> are applied to the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>. The query is issued as-is without\nadditional pre-processing such as named parameter expansion. Results of the query are mapped using\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>rowMapper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "执行一个针对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/RowsFetchSpec.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>RowsFetchSpec</code></a> 的查询，给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a>。<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/PreparedOperation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>PreparedOperation</code></a> 中提供的任何绑定均应用于底层的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>。该查询按原样发出，不进行额外的预处理（例如命名参数扩展）。查询结果使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>rowMapper</code></a> 进行映射。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the number of rows for the given entity class applying <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>. This overridden method allows users\nto further refine the selection Query using a <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> predicate to determine how many entities of the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> match the Query.",
      "translation": "返回给定实体类在应用 <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> 时的行数。此重写方法允许用户进一步使用 <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> 谓词细化选择查询，以确定有多少个给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>的实体与查询匹配。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Interface specifying a basic set of reactive R2DBC operations using entities. Implemented by\n<a href=\"R2dbcEntityTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>R2dbcEntityTemplate</code></a>. Not often used directly, but a useful option to enhance testability, as it can easily be\nmocked or stubbed.",
      "translation": "指定使用实体定义基本反应式 R2DBC 操作的接口。由<a href=\"R2dbcEntityTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>R2dbcEntityTemplate</code></a>实现。该接口通常不直接使用，但作为增强可测试性的有用选项，因为它可以轻松地进行模拟或存根处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the number of rows for the given entity class applying <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定实体类在应用<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>时的行数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Expose the underlying <a href=\"ReactiveDataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveDataAccessStrategy</code></a> encapsulating dialect specifics.",
      "translation": "暴露封装方言具体细节的底层<a href=\"ReactiveDataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveDataAccessStrategy</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Upserts the given entity, specifically insert if the row with the given identifier does not exist or update\notherwise.",
      "translation": "将给定的实体进行 Upsert 操作：如果具有给定标识符的行不存在，则插入；否则更新。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>query</code> - user-defined count <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> to execute; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>query</code> - 用户自定义的用于执行的<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>计数；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
