      "translation": "<code>query</code> - 用户定义的用于执行的<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>.",
      "translation": "底层为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
