      "translation": "底层<a href=\"../convert/R2dbcConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.convert 中的接口\"><code>R2dbcConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "exactly one result or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if no match found.",
      "translation": "exactly one result, or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if no match is found.",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - if more than one match found.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - 当找到多个匹配项时。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - if there is any problem executing the query.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\">DataAccessException</a></code> - 如果执行查询时出现任何问题。",
      "count": 1
