      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/TransientDataAccessResourceException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">TransientDataAccessResourceException</a></code> - 当更新未影响任何行时抛出。",
