      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">UnsupportedOperationException</a></code> - 如果方言不支持 upsert。",
      "count": 1
